Runtime dependencies obtained separately — not bundled
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Rosetta executes MUMPS through YottaDB inside a container image published by
WorldVistA (worldvista/vehu). Neither YottaDB nor that image is redistributed
here; scripts/bootstrap.sh pulls the image from its publisher at install time,
under that publisher's own license terms.
